#1401
A Giant Nest~
   This nest is absolutely enormous! It's been made from numerous small
saplings, more than likely from the forest below. There is an unnatural
warmth radiating from its base and a thin layer of ash covers the surface
although there are no indications as to why. Perhaps you should move along
before the owner returns...
~
