#1402
A Small Clearing~
   There is only one word to describe this, and that's breathtaking! You
stand in a small clearing of dirt, high above the earth at the northern end
of a narrow ridgeline. To the west, the peaks of the Kretrun mountains
are clearly visible, as is the Sulfur Fur Valley far below to the east and
beyond that, the Bhyroga Valley.
   Gazing to the south, a path weaves its way up to a plateau of sorts upon
which stands a large mountain keep, a stone tower that reaches even higher
towards the heavens.
   Off to the side of the clearing is a knee-high polished boulder.
~
