The Great Summoning Circle~
   As if on cue, you enter the center of the circle and it feels like time
itself has stopped. There is an immediate silence and your senses are
heightened to a greater level than you have ever known. The star now remains
a pale red color and glows softly within the darkened chamber. You gaze
down at the floor and realize it's not there - in its place, a swirling
mass of light the likes of which you have never seen!
