#1500
The Maze of Illusions~
   Sounds echo from within the darkness which surrounds you like a blanket.
You can't even see more than a few feet in front of you and the longer you
spend navigating these passages, the more disoriented you become. You have
little idea of where you actually are, let alone where you should be going.
~
14 adgh 0
D0
You can't see that far into the darkness.
~
~
